# ExoDiscover: data, artifacts, and caches.
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `data/` also matches the source
# package ml/exodiscover/data/, which silently kept schema.py and splits.py out
# of every commit and broke CI on a fresh clone.
/data/
/artifacts/
*.npy
*.pkl
*.joblib
!models/production/*.joblib
.venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.claude/
train_full.log
train_full.err
*.egg-info/
